[00:14.24]In the morning, you rise from the eastern hills
[00:21.96]How glamourous and beautiful you are
[00:29.58]Since the moment I gained memory
[00:34.30]You were the first “you” I came to know
[00:39.36]You borrow no heat from others; you always burn yourself
[00:51.12]You take no light from others; you forever illuminate the earth
[01:03.65]In winter, I chase after you, to indulge your warmth
[01:16.65]In summer, I hide from you, to escape your blazing heat
[01:49.50]Chasing you, hiding from you
[01:54.70]You are the one I love the most in my life
[01:59.62]Chasing you, hiding from you
[02:04.60]I cannot live without you in this life
[03:41.77]The sun—sometimes we hide from it
[03:46.18]For distance creates beauty
[03:50.35]When we are done hiding, we’ll come back soon
[03:53.91]Returning to embrace Spring
[03:57.23]Spring sunshine is gentle and warm
 